      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WHAT A WROUGHT (1) box seated before sticking on well to finish 3 lengths away in third (26.49) at Geelong in a Bottom Up - Grade 5 over 460m. Rates highly and will give a great sight. SHADY LADY (2) was always well back but did hit the line strongly late to finish 4th and beaten only 3.5 lengths (23.31) at this track. Comes out of a hot form race last start. Great chance to atone. TO PERU (7) turned spotting a big start finishing fourth (30.22) last time in a Mix 3/4 at Sandown. Has a good record here at this journey. Can figure in the finish. DR. MONICA (8) in the money here last time and looks a top-three prospect again.",
